    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Goldo, a lost goblin, in this short, surreal stealth adventure: sneak past hostile adventurers, uncover bizarre treasures, and unravel the dungeon's dark mystery!<br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SNEAK AROUND</strong></u> -\u00a0Use cover and tunnels to avoid gold-thirsty adventurers. Carefully time each move to stay hidden. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DISCOVER BIZARRE TREASURES</u></strong>\u00a0-\u00a0Explore for treasures left behind by the dungeon\u2019s enigmatic boss. Every discovery brings you closer to understanding its true nature. <i>All that glitters is Gold</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EXPLORE A SURREAL WORLD</u></strong> -\u00a0Journey through the Golden Nexus, a bizarre and oneiric dungeon where reality bends. Is this place a dream or a nightmare?</p></li></ul>",
